# === 2026-06-11 professional public-facing cleanup ===
# Campaign/exploration outputs are local-only by policy: reproducibility comes
# from the pre-registration git tags + frozen script SHAs (REF_PREREGISTER_
# MANIFEST.md), not from committing regenerable data dumps. Source scripts
# (.py/.c) and the curated scripts/exploration/outputs/ keepers stay tracked.

# Root-level run scratch / telemetry / plots (campaign byproducts)
/*_telemetry.csv
/*_out.txt
/*.png
/clean_gitignore.py

# Top-level exploration run dumps + nested result subtrees
scripts/exploration/results/
scripts/exploration/*.txt
scripts/exploration/*.csv
scripts/exploration/*.png

